1 (c) If the Board decides to award a monetary benefit, the benefit shall be
2 paid to the surviving spouse or, if the emergency personnel had no spouse at
3 the time of death, to the surviving child, or equally among surviving children.
4 If the deceased emergency personnel is not survived by a spouse or child, the
5 benefit shall be paid to a surviving parent, or equally between surviving
